      "updated": 1786743632782,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "VALIDATION FIRST - LET THE MODEL COOK\nYellow slice = new agent or model. No slice = same chat (PRIME to PLAN, IMPLEMENT to VALIDATE).\nGreen /skill names are real invokes. Orange = model band for that arc. Independent tickets can run in parallel (captain-crew).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VALIDATION FIRST - LET THE MODEL COOK\nYellow slice = new agent or model. No slice = same chat (PRIME to PLAN, IMPLEMENT to VALIDATE).\nGreen /skill names are real invokes. Orange = model band for that arc. Independent tickets can run in parallel (captain-crew).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
